join center [animation="Fade In"]
singer: hee hee~
set {singer.HAS_TALKED_TO} = true
- fight me
	if {singer.PLAYER_ON_STAGE} == true:
		eyyy let's go bro
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"action":"fight","subject":"singer"}"]
	else:
		singer: get up here then
- How do I get up there? | [if {singer.REDIRECT_TO_BARTENDER} == false] [else="hide"]
	singer: Backstage is locked. Ask the bartender about a key.
	singer: Once you have the key.. [wave][pause=0.5][lspeed=0.05]♫ Use it with glee ♫ [pause=0.5][lspeed=0.01]Hoo~ [pause=0.5][lspeed=0.05]♫ Come to me ♫ [pause=0.5][lspeed=0.01]Hee~ [input]
	set {singer.REDIRECT_TO_BARTENDER} = true
- exit